01:00:40,000 --> 01:00:46,000
Die Hard is an American action film series and media franchise that
originated with Roderick Thorp's 1979 novel Nothing Lasts Forever.

11
01:06:44,000 --> 01:06:50,000
All five films revolve around the main character of John McClane (Joe Leland in the original novel), a police detective who
continually finds himself in the middle of a crisis where he is both the only hope against disaster and the culprit's target.

12
01:12:48,000 --> 01:12:54,000
Per the franchise's name, McClane confounds repeated attempts to kill him, driving
his enemies to distraction, by adding up and exploiting dumb luck.

13
01:18:52,000 --> 01:18:58,000
The films have grossed a combined $1.4 billion worldwide, with Bruce
Willis as the only actor to appear in all five films.

14
01:24:56,000 --> 01:25:02,000
The tone is intense and mind_bending.
